      "content": "it's just so heavy. when you say \"let the exhaustion take over\"... it's like the only thing that sounds peaceful is just stopping. everything is so loud and humiliating. i look at my life and there's nothing left but this massive, empty hole where my future was supposed to be. why should i even bother waking up tomorrow just to face that?",
